  "promptText": {
    "original": {
      "language": "en",
      "value": "9:16 aspect ratio, generate a screenshot of a Douyin live stream, inside is Liu Yifei live streaming, Liu Yifei is holding a sign in her hand, the sign says Tonight's live stream, welcome to join Yifei for a chat!",
      "source": "upstream"
    },
    "translations": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "language": "zh-CN",
        "value": "9:16 纵向比例，生成一张抖音直播截图，画面中是刘亦菲在直播，刘亦菲手里拿着一块牌子，牌子上写着：今晚直播，欢迎来和亦菲聊天！",
        "source": "upstream"
      },
      "zh-TW": {
        "language": "zh-TW",
        "value": "9:16 長寬比，生成一張抖音直播截圖，畫面中是劉亦菲正在直播，手裡拿著牌子，牌子上寫著「今晚直播，歡迎來和亦菲聊天！」。",
        "source": "upstream"
      },
      "ja": {
        "language": "ja",
        "value": "9:16 の縦長比率で、Douyin ライブ配信のスクリーンショットを生成する。画面の中ではリウ・イーフェイがライブ配信しており、手に看板を持っている。看板には「今晚直播，欢迎来和亦菲聊天！」と書かれている。",
        "source": "upstream"
      },
      "ko": {
        "language": "ko",
        "value": "9:16 세로 비율의 도우인 라이브 스크린샷을 생성한다. 화면 속에는 류이페이가 라이브 중이며, 손에는 \"今晚直播，欢迎来和亦菲聊天！\" 이라고 적힌 팻말을 들고 있다.",
        "source": "upstream"
      },
      "fr": {
        "language": "fr",
        "value": "Au format 9:16, génère une capture d'écran de live Douyin où Liu Yifei est en direct et tient un panneau disant : \"Tonight's live stream, welcome to join Yifei for a chat!\"",
        "source": "upstream"
      },
      "de": {
        "language": "de",
        "value": "Erzeuge im 9:16-Format einen Screenshot eines Douyin-Livestreams, in dem Liu Yifei live sendet und ein Schild mit der Aufschrift \"Tonight's live stream, welcome to join Yifei for a chat!\" hält.",
        "source": "upstream"
      },
      "es": {
        "language": "es",
        "value": "En formato 9:16, genera una captura de un directo de Douyin donde Liu Yifei está transmitiendo y sostiene un cartel con el texto \"Tonight's live stream, welcome to join Yifei for a chat!\".",
        "source": "upstream"
      }
    }
  },
